                    <formatted-text>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Notes : </run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>1/ Calculations for Change Delivery Address includes Change Delivery Instructions.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>2/ Oneview Core Actions calculation contains adoption for </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Cancellations</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>and </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Comp and refunds </run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>and</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'> Change Delivery Address</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>3/</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Æ  </run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'># of backoffice changes</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> is still pending on Salesforce team and will be addressed soon</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>4/ TBD - Limiting cancellations to Customer Requested Cancellations only</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>5/ For % Change requests out of all config changes, the outcome is mostly zero. The value may be present for certain weeks, but because of aggregation over weeks, the percenatge value would always be nearly zero</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    </formatted-text>
